                        


ITEM #: SCP-5129

OBJECT CLASS: Safe

SPECIAL CONTAINMENT PROCEDURES:

this item must be hooked up to electricity at all times and kept in a well light 3 x 3 x 3 meter room

DESCRIPTION :

This sign was found at a ██████████ at █████,Florida, it is a 1/4 by 1/2 a meter in size and simply reads HAM BISCUIT. We have not been able to find a reason for its existence but it is impossible to photograph this item due to its sudden disappearance when photographed by conventional means. it is currently contained at site ██ and has been classified as safe by all scientist at the site, and has not shown a sign of sentience.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
